%SIXMD 1
# @?MOUNT.DTFS - MOUNT A DEC@TAPE FILESYSTEM

## @?OPTIONS

### @?-O OPTIONS
COMMA-SEPARATED RO OR RW ACCESS AND OPTIONAL NATIVE, TENEX, OR ITS
PERSONALITY.  THE DEFAULT IS RO WITH AUTOMATIC PERSONALITY DETECTION.

## @?OPERANDS

### @?DEVICE
DECTAPE DEVICE TO MOUNT.

### @?TARGET
EXISTING DIRECTORY TO USE AS THE MOUNT POINT.

## DESCRIPTION

MOUNT.DTFS PROBES THE MEDIA PERSONALITY AND MOUNTS THE SELECTED DECTAPE
FILESYSTEM ON TARGET.
USAGE IS 'MOUNT.DTFS [-O OPTIONS] DEVICE TARGET'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
